Commands:
  (q)uit      - exit the debugger
  (h)elp      - write this message
  (r)un       - run main function
  (p)ause     - pause running VM
  (c)ontinue  - resume VM execution
  (n)ext      - executes one Fat step
  (s)tatus    - write current VM status
  (pos)ition  - write current position
  (b)reakpoint <option> <line>
              - options: (s)et, remove
              - line: line nr in file

